  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The fire inspector continues his strict check and rejects several fire extinguishers. The restaurant owner, Dmitry, arrives and demands to know the real reason behind this sudden and aggressive inspection. Let us listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Где ваш огнетушитель?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Он висел здесь в прошлый раз.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Вы что, смеётесь надо мной?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Этот не подходит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вот нормальный огнетушитель.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "А где его пломба?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Добрый день.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Можно узнать одну вещь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Почему у вас такой интерес к ресторану?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Мы боремся с плохим руководством.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Был звонок моему начальнику.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Из соседнего ресторана.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Всё понятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Ну что, до завтра.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Где ваш огнетушитель?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is your fire extinguisher?' The official demands to see the safety equipment once again.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Он висел здесь в прошлый раз.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was hanging here last time.' Vika sounds confused, pointing out where the item used to be.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Вы что, смеётесь надо мной?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you laughing at me?' Frustrated by the disappearing equipment, the inspector feels he is being mocked.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Этот не подходит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This one is not suitable.' He rejects the replacement they offer as completely inadequate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вот нормальный огнетушитель.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is a normal fire extinguisher.' Vika presents another option, hoping this one meets the standard.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "А где его пломба?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And where is its seal?' The official immediately finds another flaw, pointing out a missing safety marker.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Добрый день.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good afternoon.' Nagiyev enters the scene smoothly, offering a polite daytime greeting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Можно узнать одну вещь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'May I know one thing?' He asks for permission to bring up a specific question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Почему у вас такой интерес к ресторану?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you have such an interest in the restaurant?' Nagiyev probes the official's unusually intense focus on their establishment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Мы боремся с плохим руководством.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are fighting with bad management.' The official justifies his harshness by claiming to crusade against poor leadership.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Был звонок моему начальнику.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There was a call to my boss.' He reveals that a complaint from higher up triggered the strict review.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Из соседнего ресторана.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From the neighboring restaurant.' The source of the trouble is finally unmasked as a rival business.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Всё понятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is clear.' Nagiyev quickly connects the dots, understanding the true motive behind the harassment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Ну что, до завтра.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, until tomorrow.' The official leaves with a threatening promise to return the next day. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Где ваш огнетушитель?",
      "gap": 0.5
