    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The fire inspector returns repeatedly to find new faults with the extinguishers until Chef Barinov learns that the rival restaurant next door called in the tip. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'fire extinguisher' and 'to hang' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
